# Copy to .env (Git-ignored) and fill in. Never commit real values.
# Any OpenAI-compatible base URL and its API key. CLIProxyAPI is one option;
# the placeholder is its default local address. The key may stay empty for a
# local server that needs no key.
EPHEMERA_UPSTREAM_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8317/v1
EPHEMERA_UPSTREAM_API_KEY=
# Optional: on (the default) sends each call's cache key as body
# prompt_cache_key and header x-session-affinity; an upstream that refuses
# them by name stops getting them by itself. off never sends them.
EPHEMERA_UPSTREAM_SESSION_CACHE=
# At least 32 random characters, e.g. `openssl rand -hex 32`; the trusted
# authentication proxy sends it in production.
EPHEMERA_PROXY_KEY=
# Optional: the key of Atelier (an optional ComfyUI backend) for creating a
# character from an image, at least 32 random characters and different from
# EPHEMERA_PROXY_KEY. It opens that one route only; leave it empty to turn the
# integration off.
EPHEMERA_INTEGRATION_KEY=
# The master key every user's data is encrypted under: 32 random bytes as 64 hex
# characters, e.g. `openssl rand -hex 32`. Required. Losing it loses every user's
# data for good, and nothing can recover it: back it up somewhere safe yourself.
EPHEMERA_DATA_KEY=
# The username the Vite dev proxy passes in Remote-User (lowercase letters,
# digits, ".", "_" and "-"); dev by default.
EPHEMERA_DEV_USER=dev
# Exact browser origin; http://localhost:5173 for the Vite dev server.
EPHEMERA_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173
# Optional, for card portraits: the bearer token of the ComfyUI set in Settings
# (Atelier requires one), and the path to a PEM CA certificate its TLS
# certificate chains to. Both stay on the server.
COMFYUI_API_KEY=
COMFYUI_CA_FILE=
# The only ComfyUI origins Settings may name, comma-separated (e.g.
# http://comfyui.local:8188); empty turns portraits off for every user.
COMFYUI_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=
# Optional: a directory of more ComfyUI workflow graphs (`<id>.json`, and
# `<id>.reference.json` for a reference graph), read once at startup beside the
# bundled ones; a file named like another stops the start.
EPHEMERA_WORKFLOWS_DIR=
# Optional: the workflow a new user starts with and a vanished choice falls
# back to (krea2-gonzalomo by default); it must have a graph.
EPHEMERA_DEFAULT_WORKFLOW=
# Optional: more ComfyUI node classes graphs may use, comma-separated (at most
# 200). Listing a class means you vouch that it keeps its output in memory; save
# and preview nodes are always refused, and naming one stops the start.
EPHEMERA_COMFYUI_EXTRA_NODES=
# Optional: EPHEMERA_HOST (127.0.0.1), EPHEMERA_PORT (8790),
# EPHEMERA_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS (600000), EPHEMERA_STATIC_DIR (built SPA),
# EPHEMERA_DATA_DIR (the repository's data/; each user's encrypted database
# under users/).
